        "id": 8482
      },
      "writtenOn": "2015-12-10T18:16:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Speaking for puppet, we would really prefer to be able to specify passwords as environment variables rather than command line options. The command shows up in the process table, in debug outputs, and sometimes in logs or reports, which in many environments is a security risk.",
      "parentUuid": "7a740942_142c4aaa",
      "revId": "5bb10f75f422544b5192d65ad2b7ae68e956da6f",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
      "unresolved": false
    },
